{"createdAt":"2026-10-03T07:01:30.803Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"poc_dialogue","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46675982","body":"厚切りジェイソンならぬ、ガチのエンジニアの「厚切りJSON」の鉄板ネタを考えて","speaker":"soumame"},{"_key":"p2","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Hello World！ガチエンジニア芸人の「厚切りJSON」ですね。あのテンションと理不尽への怒り、JSONの仕様にぶつけるにはぴったりです。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"ホワイトボードを叩きながら絶叫する姿を想像してお読みください。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p7","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p6","_type":"span","marks":["p5"],"text":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8E%9A%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BD%E3%83%B3"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p5","_type":"link","href":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8E%9A%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BD%E3%83%B3"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p8","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"【登場】"},{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" （勢いよくステージに飛び出してきて） 「Hello World！！ ガチエンジニア芸人の、厚切りJSONダヨ！！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"「いやー、今日もみんな、システム開発お疲れ様！ でも俺は怒ってるヨ！ IT業界のデファクトスタンダードみたいな顔してるあのデータ形式、おかしいこといっぱいアルヨ！！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"「今日は皆さんに、これを見てもらいたい！！」 （ホワイトボードにマジックで書き始める）"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ph","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"【ネタ1：コメントアウト】"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" 「設定ファイルとしてJSONを使うこと、よくアルヨネ。チームのみんなのために、この設定が何なのか、メモを残してあげたい。エンジニアの優しさダヨネ！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pm","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pi","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（ホワイトボードに書く） "},{"_key":"pj","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"// ここは本番環境のURL"},{"_key":"pk","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"pl","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"apiUrl\": \"https://...\""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"po","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"「よし、これで実行してみるヨ！ ……『SyntaxError: Unexpected token / in JSON』」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pu","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（目を見開いて絶叫） 「"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Why JSON format!?!?"},{"_key":"pr","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"」 「なんでコメント書けないノ！？ 人間が読むためのフォーマットって言ってたジャナイ！！ 設定ファイルで使わせるくせに、メモ残せないとか鬼畜カヨ！！ 仕方ないから "},{"_key":"ps","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"comment1\": \"ここは本番のURL\""},{"_key":"pt","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" ってダミーのキー作るエンジニアの気持ち、考えたことアルノ！？」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"px","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pv","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"【ネタ2：ケツカンマ（Trailing Commas）】"},{"_key":"pw","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" 「まあいい、コメントは諦めるヨ。次は配列ダヨ。リストに要素を追加していくの、よくある処理ダヨネ！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p16","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"py","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（ホワイトボードに書く） "},{"_key":"pz","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"["},{"_key":"p10","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p11","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"apple\","},{"_key":"p12","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p13","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"banana\","},{"_key":"p14","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p15","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"]"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p18","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p17","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"「よし、最後にバナナを追加したヨ。これで完璧ダ。実行するヨ！ ……『SyntaxError: Unexpected token ] in JSON』」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p19","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（ホワイトボードをバシィィィン！と叩いて絶叫） 「"},{"_key":"p1a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Why JSON format!?!?"},{"_key":"p1b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"」 「最後のカンマ（,）許してくれないの何で！？ JavaScriptのオブジェクトだと許されるのに、JSONになった瞬間、急に厳格になるノ！？ バージョン管理のGitで差分（diff）見るときに、カンマのせいで前の行まで変更されたことになるの、すっっっごい邪魔なんだヨ！！ 最後のカンマくらい、よしなにパースしてくれヨ！！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1d","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"【ネタ3：日付型（Date）】"},{"_key":"p1e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" 「まだあるヨ！ 現代のシステム開発、絶対に扱うデータがあるヨネ。そう、『時間』ダヨ！ ユーザーの登録日、更新日時、絶対に保存するヨネ！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1m","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1g","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（ホワイトボードに書く） "},{"_key":"p1h","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"{"},{"_key":"p1i","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p1j","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"createdAt\": 2026-07-22"},{"_key":"p1k","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p1l","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"}"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1o","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1n","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"「よし、日付を入れたヨ。これをパースして画面に出すヨ！……ってあれ？ Date型がない？」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1w","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1p","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"（頭を抱えて絶叫） 「"},{"_key":"p1q","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Why JSON format!?!?"},{"_key":"p1r","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"」 「なんで『日付型』標準で用意してないノ！？ 文字列（String）か数値（Number）しかないから、"},{"_key":"p1s","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"\"2026-07-22T12:00:00Z\""},{"_key":"p1t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" って無理やりISO 8601フォーマットの文字列にして、受け取ったフロントエンド側で毎回 "},{"_key":"p1u","_type":"span","marks":["code"],"text":"new Date()"},{"_key":"p1v","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" させてるジャナイ！！ 全世界のエンジニアが毎日毎日、文字列と日付を行ったり来たりしてるヨ！！ 時間の無駄ダロ！！」"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1z","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1x","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"【オチ】"},{"_key":"p1y","_type":"span